subject: test(observability): fix error-category integration test isolation

In full-suite runs the DB driver is module-cached and shared across test
files in the same process, so row-count assertions against a fixed
conversationId are unreliable. Assert on the exact record written (unique
per-run id) instead of total row count. Full suite: 1680 passed / 88
failed (all pre-existing baseline failures).

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (test hardening)

